# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""Image plan for the Dialysis Unit Support Staff subtrack (Renal Care Academy).

HEROES: one circular-vignette hero per page (williamriveromd-hero-vignette v3), 16 in all (hub + 15 modules;
the end-of-course check reuses the hub hero).
FIGURES: in-body teaching figures (williamriveromd-simple-figure v1 scaffolds A-E; mechanism posters M follow the
williamriveromd-biomedical-mechanism-figure layout rendered semi-photorealistically; instructional photo strips P follow
the williamriveromd-infographic-skill procedural style). A figure is placed at the end of its section only once
images/<stem>.webp (or .png) exists, so the pages never show a broken image.
Each figure records its teaching purpose: Understand (the mechanism), Apply (the action), Appreciate (why it matters).
tools/dialysis_support_staff/build_image_prompts.py turns this file into docs/dialysis-unit-support-staff/.
"""

P = "dialysis-unit-support-staff"

